  "name": "Question 4",
  "problem": "What is the reciprocal of $-\\frac{1}{13}?$",
  "worked_solution": "We flip the numerator and denominator, keeping the sign of the fraction. So the reciprocal of $-\\frac{1}{13}$ is  $-\\frac{13}{1}=-13.$",
